  "title": "licensecheck: avoid thinking a license is an \"ISC ISC\" license.",
  "description": "Don't make the license name some horror such as \"ISC ISC\" just because\nthe file contains \"SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC\" *and* the magic words\nthat identify an ISC license. (If you don't want files containing\n\"SPDX-License-Identifier\" *and* license text, check for *that* and\nrepoort *that* as the problem - and if the two don't match, also\ncomplain that the SPDX identifier doesn't match the license text.)",
